  "instructions": [
    "Pat the tilapia dry with a paper towel. Rub both sides evenly with the smoked paprika, ground cumin, and salt.",
    "Heat a portion of the olive oil in a large nonstick skillet over medium-high heat until shimmering. Add the tilapia and cook for 3 to 4 minutes per side, flipping halfway through, until the crust is golden and the fish flakes easily with a fork.",
